WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.310
Haruka...

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.890
Is that?

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:27.120
It's him.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.270
Haruka!

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:43.680
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:50.010
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:56.190
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:01.620
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:07.660
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:14.000
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:19.880
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:25.930
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:31.770
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:37.940
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:41.130
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:46.280
Even in the driving wind

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:53.220
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:58.880
Misekku kesta

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:06.800
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.440
Yuu.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:33.720
Are you okay?

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:37.160
Are you in pain?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.070
Don't worry about it.

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:40.380
Get away from her!

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.130
Yuu!

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.110
What're you doing?!
Let's go outta here!

00:02:49.110 --> 00:02:52.650
You're wrong!
He saved me!

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.580
What?

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:56.990
Are you okay, Karasu?
Did it hurt?

00:02:56.990 --> 00:03:00.890
Never mind. It's temporary.
I'll recover soon.

00:03:00.890 --> 00:03:03.760
Don't be foolish.
We can't leave you like this.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.950
Come on, Yuu, help me out.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.130
Don't mess with me!

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.040
Huh?

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.090
Yuu?

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:17.970
Sheesh! What's he all angry about?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.140
Are you okay?

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:26.750
I forgot. I can't go around
looking like this.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.540
How am I gonna get home?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.960
Whaaat?!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.790
I can't believe what
Karasu has done... that idiot.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.600
He even severed his pipeline
to protect the Dragon Torque.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:55.240
Karasu's betrayal will not be tolerated.

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:59.050
We will get rid of him ourselves.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.780
Karasu...

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:05.800
He knows damn well that
she isn't the same Haruka.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.060
How did it go?

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.200
Nowhere. She's not here either.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.100
I knew it! Haruka has been
taken to another universe!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:24.170
A place populated by people equipped
with science far superior to our own!

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:26.270
Shove a sock in it, Miho!

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:28.040
What should we do, Yukie-chan?

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:34.120
For now, let's recheck all the
places she might have gone to.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.620
Okay! Hey, Hasebe!
Move over to the back.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:39.220
Huh? Why should I?

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:42.660
Hey, he wants to sit
next to Yukie-chan!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.220
Y-You idiot.
That's... impossible!

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:49.120
Yuu, what's up?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.900
Haruka is back now.

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:55.340
Huh? For real? Impossible. Where is she?

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:59.710
Don't worry. She's with
someone she counts on.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.670
What do you mean, Yuu?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.510
Bye.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.110
Yuu? Hello?

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:06.180
What is it?

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:07.980
Has Haruka-chan been found?

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.790
That's what he said...

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.990
Thank god.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.040
Geez. I'm gonna cut Haruka
a new one for this!

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.500
Hello, Kaminogi residence.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.880
Oh, Ai-chan!

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:39.950
Um, is Haruka back home?

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.610
Haruka? Hold on a minute.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.520
Haruka? Phone!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:47.110
Hello?!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.820
What the?

00:05:50.230 --> 00:05:51.870
Hold on just a second.

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:55.630
You're handy!

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.090
Are you home, Haruka?

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:02.630
Huh? Aiya...

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:07.880
I'm telling ya...

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.170
Hide in here for now, okay?

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.140
I'll be back later.

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:20.920
Haruka, are you home or not?

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.440
I'm home, I'm home!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.880
Well, when you got home
why didn't you say so?

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.200
I was in deep thought.

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:28.900
Ai-chan's on the phone for you.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.360
Ai?

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.070
Hey, Ai. How ya doin'?

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:38.210
Stupid! That's what I'd like to know!

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:40.740
Where have you been?!
I've been looking all over for you!

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:43.810
Are you okay? Were you implanted
with a strange piece of metal?!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:46.920
Tell me, Ai. What time is it?
What day is today?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.820
Huh?

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.150
How long has it been
since I went missing?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:52.430
About 3 hours, actually...

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.160
Three hours?

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.680
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.550
What is it, Baron?

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:03.400
S-Sorry, gotta go!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.370
What?! Hey!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.650
No, don't!

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:10.540
Is something in there?

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.140
Wh... Why would there be?

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.740
Very suspicious. You brought
something home, didn't you?

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.160
I... I didn't!

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:20.480
Every time you bring something home,
you always hide it in here.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:22.670
Huh? Hey, wait!

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:32.350
That's disappointing,
there's nothing in here.

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.800
I told you there wasn't, didn't I?

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:36.950
That's no fun.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.520
Now are you satisfied?

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.800
By the way...

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.500
What's with the get-up?

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:52.670
Um, I'm g-gonna be in a play with
Ai and the gang. This is the costume.

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:55.410
What do you think?

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.620
- It looks pretty good.
- Doesn't it?!

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.190
Baron, you keep this
secret from Mom, okay?

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.770
I don't get it.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:22.430
They said it's only been
three hours since I went missing.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.710
I'm sure I was in that world
for longer than that.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:29.020
That's because you leaped
between space and time.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:30.810
Space and time?

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.710
I gotta get changed.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:00.150
I want you to stop
using your window as a door.

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:02.180
You're not a dog or a cat.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:08.190
What's happened to you, Yuu?
Don't cause me any more worry.

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:10.230
Go back to the good boy
you used to be...

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.360
Stop it!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:14.990
It's my future, not yours.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:16.700
I'll decide what to do with it!

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:18.500
That's impossible!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.490
It's just not... possible.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.960
Yuu, wait right there!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.310
Yuu! Come back here!

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:29.430
Let go of me!

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.250
Why?

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.680
Why won't you understand?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.760
Do you hate your mother, Yuu?

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:48.890
Yuu!

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:54.630
Yuu...

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.580
Leave it to us! We'll treat you!
We'll foot the bill for everything!

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:41.370
He's an awesome singer!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:02.160
Hello? Oh, it's you, dear...

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:05.110
Yes...

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:08.870
So you'll be staying at
the office tonight? I see...

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.210
No, there's no problem with that.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.850
Yes. Yuu is doing fine.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:17.480
Yes...

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.430
I'm pooped.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:04.890
I'm so freakin' pooped... Ugh...

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:09.100
You might as well get used to it
because complaining won't help.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.810
Oh, shaddap.

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:13.210
I feel so heavy, dammit.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:15.880
Anyway, let's find something to eat.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:22.760
Atori! This looks like
it's still edible.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.420
I ain't touching that crap.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:29.420
But we need to take in
something right now...

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:32.260
Hah! This is pathetic!

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:36.860
Without our pipelines attached, we're
reduced to below average in this world.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.900
Get used to it.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.030
We were lucky not to
have any withdrawal symptoms.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.010
They fed me some crap about
altering every cell in my body...

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.340
on a quantum level to make me beefed up.

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:51.040
And poked and prodded me, for THIS.

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:55.180
And to think I'm gonna perish...

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:57.040
In this depressing dimension!

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:02.660
But you know the
effects of Shangri-la...

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:05.090
will spread to this dimension too.

00:13:05.730 --> 00:13:08.800
Any way you look at it,
it's all going down the tubes.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.890
What's with those guys?
They're really weak now.

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.150
Oh, that's right.

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:21.370
Tobi, get me water!
Find me water!

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.300
Very well.

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:28.450
I found water, Atori!

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.740
Are you awake, Karasu?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.080
I'm coming in.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:04.950
Morning! How do you feel?
Do you feel a little better now?

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:08.720
Don't worry. I'm fine now.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:11.460
Are you hungry? Is there
anything special you'd like?

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:13.060
I'll bring it to you.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:16.200
My body doesn't require much food.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.900
I would like some water if you have it.

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:21.460
Really? All you want is water?

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:24.680
Please, Haruka.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.940
Okay, coming right up!

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.630
Just sit tight!

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:59.030
Why are you called Karasu?

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.480
In our world...

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:04.770
when you become a soldier,
you are given a new name.

00:15:05.310 --> 00:15:07.920
Karasu is the name I was given.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.610
I see.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.450
Karasu,

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:16.610
is it true that, that world is
really one of our futures?

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.350
Yes. It's one of the parallel universes.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.960
Is it hard to believe?

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:25.300
Oh... It's not that.

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:28.570
After all, I think
that woman really was Ai.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.330
And besides...

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:38.010
Are you wondering
about your own future?

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:41.210
Oh, no! My future doesn't matter.

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:44.420
But please tell me one thing.

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:48.430
Are you, Karasu, Yuu 15 years into the future?

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.690
What makes you think that?

00:15:57.300 --> 00:15:58.220
Just a hunch.

00:15:58.530 --> 00:15:59.890
I see.

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:02.440
Haruka.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.470
I am an illusion in this dimension.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.980
It doesn't matter who I am.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.410
Really...

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:13.140
That makes sense.
You are who you are!

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:25.170
What's the matter, Baron?
Is someone there?

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.490
Yuu...

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.830
Yuu, why are you out so early?

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.840
You forgot this.

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:44.880
Oh, right! That fell off. Thanks.

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.680
Did something happen
with your mom again?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.550
That's none of your business.

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:57.230
Don't talk to me like that!
We've all been worried about you!

00:16:57.230 --> 00:17:00.420
Forget about it!
I slept in the park last night.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.660
Huh?

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.690
I'm not going back home ever again.

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.170
Bye.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.880
Hey, Yuu?!

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:09.400
Wait up a minute!

00:17:09.400 --> 00:17:10.870
What do you want?!

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:12.510
Just come with me.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:13.920
Hey!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.110
Miyuki, what're you doing?

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:32.860
Oh, you're still eating.

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:35.900
I have morning practice,
so I'm going without you.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.690
Don't be late for school.

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:41.970
Emi...

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:46.120
Yuu... I have to find Yuu.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.220
What's going on? Leave me alone.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.600
Oh, come on. Have you eaten?

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.320
Hey, Baron. Long time no see.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.370
Oops. Cut it out! Hey...

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.930
Hey!

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.940
Hey, cut it out!

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.320
Really... Baron,
you're being too playful!

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.470
I'll get you for that!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:28.950
Hey, what's wrong?
What happened?

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.830
What about you?
Where did YOU go?

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:31.800
Huh?

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:35.290
Everyone was looking
for you worried sick!

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:38.560
D... Don't worry about me.

00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:39.590
Hey...

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.770
Anyway!

00:18:41.730 --> 00:18:43.800
What happened with you?

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:46.100
Did you really stay out
all night last night?

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.770
That's none of your business!

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.770
It is so! We promised to
run away together, remember?

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:54.080
Yeah right!
You're the one who forgot.

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.530
I didn't forget. I just...

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:59.210
Yeesh. I don't want excuses.

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.170
Right, Baron? You agree
with me, don't you, boy?

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.790
Is Haruka still sleeping?

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:22.500
So, what are you gonna do?

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:25.470
I bet your mom's worried about you.

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:27.610
Just keep out of my business.

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:31.340
If you hate the exams that much,
then you should say so.

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:34.400
It's not that simple.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.280
Huh?

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:40.530
You know that my mom
didn't used to be like that.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:43.820
Yeah, she always told me
to study and all...

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.890
but she's not the same.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:49.730
Was it two years ago?
When it started?

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:51.370
Yeah, I think so.

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:54.630
It probably started around the time
my grandma in Sapporo died.

00:19:57.870 --> 00:20:00.240
- That's right.
- What is it?

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:03.770
Mom did something on the train
returning home from the funeral.

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:08.250
Mother, are you happy to see her again?

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:13.750
Are you happy now? You loved Emi
a lot, so I'm sure you are...

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.320
Mother...

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:17.690
Who's Emi?

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:22.560
She probably meant my aunt.
I've never met her.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:23.530
How come?

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.700
Well, I believe she died
in a traffic accident...

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.800
when she was in high school.

00:20:28.800 --> 00:20:31.060
What? She's dead?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:35.040
I wonder why your mom
would say something like that?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.880
Beats me. I'm feeling kind of hungry.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:40.550
Oh... Want me to get you something?

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:43.850
You keep candy in your desk drawer,
don't you? I'll have that.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.340
Hey, stop that!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:49.420
Don't go through people's
desks without asking!

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:51.490
You haven't got anything
important in there.

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:52.790
I said stop!

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.060
See? Found some!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.630
Hey, my chocolate!

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:00.430
If you're hungry,
I'll go get you something!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:03.630
You haven't changed a bit ever
since you were a shrimpy kid.

00:21:04.310 --> 00:21:07.100
If you keep eating stuff like this...

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:09.370
you'll turn into a porker!

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:12.880
You haven't changed a bit either!
Give it back!

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:19.070
Really... What's she doing with
Baron so early in the morning?

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:21.720
Give it back!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.180
I don't THINK so!

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:25.850
You!

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:27.700
Porker girl.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.850
Hey, quit it!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.890
- Porker!
- Don't call me a porker!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:35.790
What is it, Baron?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:37.910
Huh?

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:39.600
What's up?

00:21:40.910 --> 00:21:42.610
Mom!

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:45.310
She's come looking for you...

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:46.450
Tell her I'm not here!

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.620
- What?!
- Just tell her!

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:51.320
But if she finds out...

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:53.580
I know! Come over here.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.090
Huh? Hey!

00:21:55.090 --> 00:21:56.370
Where are we going?!

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.230
Hide in this room!

00:21:58.230 --> 00:21:59.990
Karasu is in here too,
but don't let it bother you.

00:21:59.990 --> 00:22:00.590
What?!

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:08.770
But why... are you?

00:22:11.340 --> 00:22:13.800
Coming! I'll be right there!

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:18.140
This is not good... What'll I do?

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:24.820
Coming! Just give me a second!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.610
Excuse me for intruding
so early in the morning.

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:28.260
Yuu, you're here, aren't you?

00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:29.490
Um...

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:31.760
I know he's in here.
Out of my way!

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.320
You can't!

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.230
I knew it.

00:22:49.410 --> 00:22:50.970
Come in.

00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:54.380
What's wrong? Afraid?

00:22:57.550 --> 00:22:59.240
C'mere!

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:30.380
A sleepless night

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.270
The sound of the second hand

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:41.200
The rumble of the
refrigerator in the air

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:45.990
Just as the moon
through the blinds...

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.900
Waxes and wanes, someday...

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:56.490
The pain will change to warmth

00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:01.710
Boat of time...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:06.960
No matter where it flows...

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:13.090
Most likely we'll meet again

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:16.730
From scars come the
footsteps of dawn

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:19.930
Rather than sighing,
they secretly...

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:26.040
come pouring down
on every new day

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:30.580
No matter what sky it is

00:24:42.220 --> 00:24:45.390
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:47.180
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:50.260
Yuu, come on out!

00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:56.310
You're such a spineless twit!

00:25:00.610 --> 00:25:03.430
You don't understand a thing about me!

00:25:04.280 --> 00:25:07.680
Next episode, Beyond Time

00:25:07.680 --> 00:25:10.400
Do you remember the old days?
